OL,3,AGlobal scramble to fix critical
OL,4,Acyber-security flaws as many websites
OL,5,Ataken offline
OL,6,
OL,7,FOrganisations around the world are
OL,8,Fscrambling to fix a critical
OL,9,Fcyber-security flaw that could affect
OL,10,Fmillions of websites
OL,12,FThe vulnerability is within the PHP
OL,13,Fprogramming language, which is used to
OL,14,Fpower many platforms. PHP collects
OL,15,Finformation you need and presents it in
OL,16,Fa way you can read on the web
OL,18,FThe issue may affect around 30 million
OL,19,Fwebsites and could allow attackers to
OL,20,Fsteal personal data, one expert tells
OL,21,Fthe BBC
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1792653951
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGlobal scramble to fix critical
OL,4,Acyber-security flaws as many websites
OL,5,Ataken offline
OL,6,
OL,7,FArtificial intelligence identified the
OL,8,Fissue, prompting warnings from
OL,9,Fgovernments and cyber-security agencies
OL,10,Fto take sites offline
OL,12,F"Where immediate remediation is not
OL,13,Ffeasible, organisations should consider
OL,14,Ftaking the system offline until it can
OL,15,Fbe fully mitigated," the UK's National
OL,16,FCyber Security Centre says
OL,18,FAmong the impacted sites are Wikipedia,
OL,19,FEdinburgh council, many online stores
OL,20,Fand the BBC
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
